140	/**
141	 * A single DNS label for a subdomain (the part left of the primary domain, e.g.
142	 * "shop" in shop.example.com). No dots — a subdomain is exactly one label deep;
143	 * lowercase alnum + internal hyphens only, so it is shell-inert AND a valid
144	 * hostname label + directory name.
