1159	/**
1160	 * Drop the Adminer DB manager into the account's OWN webroot at a hard-to-guess
1161	 * randomized path, served by the account's own PHP-FPM socket via the existing
1162	 * vhost (a non-dot directory, so the vhost's `location ~ /\.` deny rule doesn't
1163	 * shadow it, and it survives the SSL/health vhost reinstalls — no per-account
1164	 * `location` block that a self-heal could wipe).
